{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "7187d3db-105f-80ac-9f6a-e50077606b31",
  "created_at": "2026-02-17T12:51:10-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Joao Raposo",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T12:48:47-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T12:48:51-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, good afternoon. My name is Joao Raposo. I'm calling for my mother, she's the one who lives at the house, and it's about a Christmas tree that's still sitting out at the curb."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T12:49:03-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a Christmas tree at the curb. And where is the house, Mr. Raposo?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T12:49:09-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 28 Gidley Street, in the Fifth Ward. The tree's been out there since, oh, the second week of January, I'd say. Nobody has taken it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T12:49:19-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Twenty-eight Gidley Street. Got it. And you put it out for the Christmas tree pickup, is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T12:49:26-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. My mother heard there was a pickup for the trees after the holiday, so I dragged it out there for her. And it's still sitting. I don't know if we missed the date or if we did something wrong, maybe it had to be a certain way."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T12:49:43-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Did it have any lights or ornaments left on it, or a stand, or is it bare?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T12:49:50-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, it's bare. I took everything off. No bag on it either, just the tree laying by the curb."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T12:49:57-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so bare, no bag, no stand. That's how it's supposed to go out. I can't tell you from here whether the pickup window has closed on your route, and I'd rather not give you the wrong date. Is there a number where somebody can reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T12:50:13-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, I was going to ask, I would like a supervisor to call me back about it, if that's possible. I'd like to know if somebody's coming or if I should haul it somewhere myself."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T12:50:25-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can ask a supervisor to call you. What's the best number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T12:50:30-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 401-555-0166."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T12:50:32-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-six-six. And that's for Joao Raposo, about the tree at 28 Gidley Street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T12:50:38-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's it. And if they could call before the end of the week, I'd appreciate it. My little one has a recorder concert next week, and we're going to have family coming by the house, so I'd like the curb cleaned up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T12:50:53-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood, before the end of the week if they can. I'll put that in the note. Anything else I can help with today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T12:51:02-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's all. Thank you very much, Lorraine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T12:51:06-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Raposo. Enjoy the rest of your afternoon."
    }
  ],
